#     prefix's defaults/named arguments before packing the variadic tail.
#   - DEFAULT-IS-CONST (G4, ruling T2), in `src/checker/typer.tks`. `check_param_defaults` types each
#     `default_expr` and forwards it to `is_const_expr` (the D1 const gate), run from both function
